     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">We are back tomorrow after last week’s hiatus, in Wickson 1017, 1-3pm. Bring your laptops, and I’ll bring cookies.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Next week (4/18) I will give a talk on learning to automate with R. We will broadcast via Google Hangouts and will send that link out before the talk. Here is a quick description:</p>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:1.2em 0px;border-left-width:4px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(221,221,221);padding:0px 1em;color:rgb(119,119,119);quotes:none\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Access the power of R through the apply-family of functions and by writing your own functions. You’ll save time, headaches, and mistakes. This is an “advanced-beginner” talk intended to get people started or more comfortable with automation. If you find yourself copy-and-pasting R code, this is for you! If you have multiple data files to process, this is for you! If you want to become an R wizard but aren’t sure what the next steps are, this is for you! </p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Michael Levy</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">PhD Candidate<br>Department of Environmental Science and Policy<br>University of California, Davis<br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mal...@ucdavis.edu</a><br><a href=\"http://www.michaellevy.name/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.michaellevy.name/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467377535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-zCm6o8aC9UyPemyZqxzt\">www.michaellevy.name</a></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21haWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNh\r\nbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQtc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij5IaSBhbGwsPC9kaXY+PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21h\r\naWxfZGVmYXVsdCIgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiB0YWhvbWEsIHNhbnMtc2VyaWY7IGZvbnQt\r\nc2l6ZTogc21hbGw7Ij4